# Squandered Resources: "Add one mana of any type the sacrificed land could produce" (CR 106.7). Bot1 sacrifices a
# Strip Mine, which could produce only colorless, and answers {C} with Color: C — the one type no color can name
# (CR 105.1). The Swamp and Forest beside it are candidates too, which is why the line names the sacrifice.

